    "label": {
      "en": "Minimum deduction for earnings"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tinty_ded_minamt"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The floor on the standard 10% professional-expenses deduction for earned income, guaranteeing a minimum deduction even for low earners; latest value €509, with 17 recorded historical values. It is used in tinty_fr's BenCalc function (Comp_LowLim parameter, \"Tax deductions/ allowances for C1 income\"). Theme_doc taxes.md confirms the earned-income deduction range \"(€509 to €14,555)\", of which €509 is the floor."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Parameters for determining net taxable income (RNI)"
    },
